{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38122","headline":"同年前虞部李郎中自长沙赴行在余以紫石砚赠之赋诗代书 · 韩偓","name":"同年前虞部李郎中自长沙赴行在余以紫石砚赠之赋诗代书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斧柯新样胜珠玑，堪赞星郎染翰时。\n不向东垣修直疏，即须西掖草妍词。\n紫光称近丹青笔，声韵宜裁锦绣诗。\n蓬岛侍臣今放逐，羡君回去逼龙墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}